<title>USA: Glenborough prices 6.3 mln shrs at 22-5/8.</title>
<headline>Glenborough prices 6.3 mln shrs at 22-5/8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co said on Friday 6.3 million shares of diversified real estate investment trust Glenborough Realty Trust Inc were priced at 22-5/8 per share.</p>
<p>Glenborough stock rose 3/8 to 23 in active trade.</p>
<p>The trust said in March it was offering 3.5 million common shares under a shelf registration declared effective by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in February.</p>
<p>It said would use the proceeds to fund acquisition activities and repay outstanding debt.</p>
<p>Glenborough named Bear, Stearns as the lead manager for the offering.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
